  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueManager
  dialogueEntry:
  - That's correct, Mr. Casignia! 6 x 7 is 42.
  - You feel accomplished after saying the right answer. Yet the lesson still continues
    as time goes by.
  - (You and your classmates continue to learn as the class continues, then few moments
    later...)
  - Time's up for today's class see you next time!
  - Class has been finished for now, and you and your classmates are packing up to
    prepare to leave school.
