  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueManager
  dialogueEntry:
  - You finally got to the store, but you realized you forgot to ask what beverage
    you're supposed to buy.
  - You try to remember Philip's preference but you only remembered his dislikes.
    He dislikes beverages that arent fresh or natural.
