  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d5b3f2013407b734e8bbac50f06506da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueManager
  dialogueEntry:
  - I got no choice, i have to book a car ride home.
  - You booked a car home, the trip home was still fairly long but thankfully the
    inside of the car was cold and it helped slow down the melting of the ice.
  - You got home with the beverages successfully.
  - Welcome back, Casignia! You made it back home over the sunset!
  - Hey Supapo, I bought you some Mango Fruit Tea. Here you go!
  - Thanks, Casignia. And we are just about to have dinner together, too!
  - Another productive day has come to an end. It is unknown on what will the next
    day will bring for Casignia and his friends.
  - The best of the adventure has yet to come...
