  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueManager
  dialogueEntry:
  - Hey Wanawan, please allow me to buy lunch for you.
  - Really, Casignia? Thank you very much!
  - You are welcome, Wanawan. Because that's what Himmel the Hero would have done.
    You can pay me back when you can.
  - No problem at all! Let's just finish our food before our next class.
  - You and your friends all eat and is ready for your next classes.
