  - You searched around your room for any necessary things that you need to bring.
  - You have found a backpack, which contains all of the neccesary things that you
    need to bring to school.
  - Your backpack contains a laptop, notebooks, and a pencil case.
  - It is a good thing I have my big backpack! Now, I better get going already.
